]},{"text":"Traceroute를 해 보고 싶은가? 그렇다면 라우터 추적을 위해 여러 출발지 리스트","words":[{"text":"Traceroute를","x":214,"y":1427,"width":202,"height":35},{"text":"해","x":430,"y":1425,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"보고","x":478,"y":1428,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"싶은가?","x":561,"y":1425,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"그렇다면","x":693,"y":1425,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"라우터","x":847,"y":1425,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"추적을","x":963,"y":1425,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":1084,"y":1425,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":1168,"y":1425,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"출발지","x":1249,"y":1426,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"리스트","x":1370,"y":1428,"width":98,"height":37}]},{"text":"에 대한 웹 인터페이스를 제공하는 사이트(http://www.traceroute.org/ 방문을 추천한","words":[{"text":"에","x":150,"y":1484,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":199,"y":1484,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"웹","x":281,"y":1485,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":331,"y":1485,"width":200,"height":38},{"text":"제공하는","x":547,"y":1486,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"사이트(http://www.traceroute.org/","x":697,"y":1486,"width":536,"height":40},{"text":"방문을","x":1250,"y":1486,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"추천한","x":1366,"y":1489,"width":103,"height":36}]},{"text":"다. 출발지를 선택하고 임의의 목적지 호스트 네임을 입력하라. Traceroute 프로그램","words":[{"text":"다.","x":149,"y":1544,"width":41,"height":37},{"text":"출발지를","x":208,"y":1544,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"선택하고","x":360,"y":1546,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"임의의","x":513,"y":1546,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"목적지","x":627,"y":1546,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":745,"y":1548,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"네임을","x":865,"y":1544,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"입력하라.","x":986,"y":1545,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"Traceroute","x":1147,"y":1550,"width":168,"height":29},{"text":"프로그램","x":1332,"y":1550,"width":133,"height":36}]},{"text":"이 모든 일을 대신할 것이다. Traceroute에 그래픽 인터페이스를 제공하는 무료 소프","words":[{"text":"이","x":151,"y":1605,"width":28,"heig