"height":37},{"text":"시스템에서의","x":830,"y":1842,"width":202,"height":39},{"text":"추가적인","x":1051,"y":1843,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"중요한","x":1204,"y":1845,"width":104,"height":35},{"text":"지연이","x":1324,"y":1845,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"있","x":1442,"y":1845,"width":30,"height":37}]},{"text":"을 수 있다. 예를 들어, 공유 매체며: 와이파이 혹은 게이를 모뎀)로 패킷을 전송하고","words":[{"text":"을","x":150,"y":1900,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":198,"y":1900,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":248,"y":1900,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":339,"y":1900,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"들어,","x":421,"y":1902,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"공유","x":512,"y":1903,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"매체며:","x":596,"y":1903,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"와이파이","x":736,"y":1902,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"혹은","x":888,"y":1903,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"게이를","x":973,"y":1904,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"모뎀)로","x":1090,"y":1904,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1222,"y":1904,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"전송하고","x":1340,"y":1904,"width":133,"height":37}]},{"text":"자 하는 종단 시스템은 다른 종단 시스템들과 매체를 공유하기 위해 프로토콜의 일부","words":[{"text":"자","x":150,"y":1959,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"하는","x":198,"y":1959,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"종단","x":280,"y":1960,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"시스템은","x":365,"y":1960,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":515,"y":1962,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"종단","x":597,"y":1961,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"시스템들과","x":681,"y":1961,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"매체를","x":867,"y":1963,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"공유하기","x":985,"y":1963,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"위해","x":1139,"y":1963,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":1221,"y":1964,"width":167,"height":36},{"text":"일부","x":1409,"y":1964,"width":64,"height":37}]},{"text":"로 전송을 의도적으로 지연시길 수 있다. 아에서 그러한 프로토콜을 자세히 고려할 것","words":[{"text":"로","x":150,"y":2022,"width":33,"height":28},{"text":"전송을","x":199,"y":2018,"width":100,"height":38},{"